{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9da6fbd497ece7439b05369849b69c089d77cc219ac14998192eae4b226652bc", "ja": "ライブお疲れさま、朋花。\nお客さんも大盛り上がりで、よかったな。", "zh": "演唱会辛苦你了，朋花。\n观众们的气氛也相当热烈，表现得很好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "b6e333ddc988b740ed398dbe3dd36e66e96aa3eda2e633731e560bea55e2de51", "ja": "そうですね～。子豚ちゃん達の幸せそうな顔が\n見られて、私も嬉しかったですよ～♪", "zh": "是啊～能看到小猪们幸福的表情，\n我也很高兴～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3388559a6dd816ccfdf22a499193ff9a6c480a02595219d19e7a0778e638c4dc", "ja": "パーティーの時も、朋花は堂々としてたな。\nいろいろ助かったよ。", "zh": "派对时朋花也表现得很大方呢。\n真是受你帮了不少忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "b2aebb57c16460e1cd5edbf1af21daefebb187941ad60a1fb779d2fc2a64fdaa", "ja": "聖母たる者……いかなる時であろうと、\nその振る舞いは変わりません～。", "zh": "身为圣母……无论何时，\n都不会改变言行举止～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9bc1314ebc283e6bb8a4bc111b621b27f50f731d8772290d964e47a91b3d47bc", "ja": "そうだったな。そもそも朋花が、ファンである\n子豚ちゃん達の前で、緊張するわけがなかったな。", "zh": "也是，朋花本来就不会\n在身为粉丝的小猪们面前紧张嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "340bc000ae1bfc64e5723911808baebf3570d2fd945e6ef88350154a6e5f6e61", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね～。私はいつでも、\n子豚ちゃん達からの愛を感じていますよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊～无论何时，\n我都能感受到小猪们的爱喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "a36a4610f31c990f0eff0b1c91f2a8a42755a0a20081362815868082646a94d4", "ja": "けど、もっともっと、世界中の子豚ちゃんの心を、\n聖母からの愛で満たしてあげなくては～。", "zh": "不过这还不够，我得把世上所有小猪们的心，\n都用圣母的爱来填满～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "2a6bf49b011b84a36e2d2d61e6b2276cea87b28c04394cdc143b22a15c9f1879", "ja": "そのためにも、私を支えるのが、\n{$P$}さんの仕事ですよ～？", "zh": "为了实现这个目标，{$P$}先生\n的工作就是在我身边支持我喔～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "761b743949e1a4d33a904f003f7d990e25471ca6860ea088bf986282a2a04718", "ja": "そうだな。子豚ちゃんを支えるのが朋花の役目なら、\n朋花を支えるのは、俺に任しておけ。", "zh": "是啊，既然支持小猪是朋花的职责，\n那支持朋花的事就交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "c48437e99001f7769f218e2425da24c5372af9beb1ca3f4ea59025ce1ef0e32d", "ja": "……まったく、不思議な人ですね～。\n私の心を、こんなふうにかき乱したりして……。", "zh": "……你真是个不可思议的人呢～\n居然能轻易打乱我的心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1012_p", "source_sha256": "85a27a0696be8483beeca589a1b16edfa3659dda2ef0a4224737f2daa4a0921e", "ja": "朋花？", "zh": "朋花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0023_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "7d54a8932ceb41c95063407934573a3aceba02a87d45d2f1163806e159006073", "ja": "うふふ、なんでもありませんよ～。\nさあ、帰りますよ。ダメプロデューサー♪", "zh": "呵呵，没事喔～\n好了，我们回去吧，无能制作人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
